{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":603.3599853515625,"text":"♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ ♪♪ Hi, good morning, everyone, and welcome to New York. This is our third event in New York. We had two in 2025 with some of our greatest speakers that we've ever had at AI Engineer. So we're really excited to be back. So just a huge welcome from myself and SWIX to everyone. Thanks for attending today. We hope you're going to have a great few days. There's very, very few places like New York City, as we know. Where big ideals scale very, very fast. It is where frontier AI comes to meet centuries-old global financial institutions and where multiple different economies thrive together. So we're excited to have an incredible lineup. You're going to hear from some of the world's best speakers, just like at all our events. We have got people. We've got tracks in finance. We've got engineering, leadership, evals, and LLM. We've got Parna Dink-Dinakaran, going to get that right, from Arise. We've got Max Kanat-Alexander from Capital One and Tariq Shoukat from Sonar. That's just a few of the incredible speakers that we've got this week. I'm going to say a huge thank you to Arise, who is our presenting sponsor. You guys can go and meet their team in the expo at any point this week. So lean in to learning here. Lean in to connecting as well. There's so many people here that are sharing ideas. They want to talk about the ideas. They want to challenge ideas, and they want to collaborate as well. So make sure to speak to as many people as possible, your attendees, speakers, and all the sponsors. And we hope to see you again soon. We do have a great lineup. We've got another event called Summit in San Francisco in November.","segments":[{"id":0,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"end":10.0,"text":" ♪♪","tokens":[50364,220,158,247,103,158,247,103,50864],"temperature":0.0,"avg