:518.0,"text":" There's very, very few places like New York City, as we know.","tokens":[51564,821,311,588,11,588,1326,3190,411,1873,3609,4392,11,382,321,458,13,51764],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19902268052101135,"compression_ratio":1.5730769634246826,"no_speech_prob":0.3499027490615845},{"id":58,"seek":51800,"start":519.0,"end":522.0,"text":" Where big ideals scale very, very fast.","tokens":[50414,2305,955,30956,4373,588,11,588,2370,13,50564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.20572905242443085,"compression_ratio":1.5316455364227295,"no_speech_prob":0.003016536822542548},{"id":59,"seek":51800,"start":523.0,"end":527.0,"text":" It is where frontier AI comes to meet centuries-old","tokens":[50614,467,307,689,35853,7318,1487,281,1677,13926,12,2641,50814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.20572905242443085,"compression_ratio":1.5316455364227295,"no_speech_prob":0.003016536822542548},{"id":60,"seek":51800,"start":527.0,"end":529.0,"text":" global financial institutions","tokens":[50814,4338,4669,8142,50914],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.20572905242443085,"compression_ratio":1.5316455364227295,"no_speech_prob":0.003016536822542548},{"id":61,"seek":51800,"start":529.0,"end":532.0,"text":" and where multiple different economies thrive together.","tokens":[50914,293,689,3866,819,23158,21233,1214,13,51064],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.20572905242443085,"compression_ratio":1.5316455364227295,"no_speech_prob":0.003016536822542548},{"id":62,"seek":51800,"start":532.0,"end":535.0,"text":" So we're excited to have an incredible lineup.","tokens":[51064,407,321,434,2919,281,362,364,4651,26461,13,51214],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.20572905242443085,"compression_ratio":1.5316455364227295,"no_speech_prob":0.003016536822542548},{"id":63,"seek":51800,"start":535.0,"end":538.0,"text":" You're going to hear from some of the world's best speakers,","tokens":[51214,509,434,516,281,1568,490,512,295,264,1002,311,1151,9518,11,51364],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":